        "original_id": "c6c2e883-fa33-59e9-a372-bcb22a459b0f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Stella Artois\n- Concepts: Reassuringly Expensive\n- Places: United Kingdom\n- Works: Jean de Florette\n- People: Gérard Depardieu, Daniel Auteuil, Yves Montand\n- Awards: BAFTA\n\nFacts:\n- Stella Artois used “Reassuringly Expensive” as its advertising slogan in the United Kingdom from 1982 until 2007.\n- Jean de Florette starred Gérard Depardieu, Daniel Auteuil, and Yves Montand.\n- Daniel Auteuil won a BAFTA award for his performance in Jean de Florette.\n- Yves Montand appeared in Jean de Florette in one of his last roles before his death.",
